   "text": "imports  \u2192     juicebox-web  \u2192  @aidenlab/juicebox-remote  \u2192  juicebox.js (peer dependency)\n               juicebox-mcp  \u2192  @aidenlab/juicebox-remote/protocol   (message types only)\n               nothing imports juicebox-mcp \u00b7 juicebox.js imports none of the others",
   "originalText": "imports  \u2192     juicebox-web  \u2192  @aidenlab/juicebox-remote  \u2192  juicebox.js (peer dependency)\n               juicebox-mcp  \u2192  @aidenlab/juicebox-remote/protocol   (message types only)\n               nothing imports juicebox-mcp \u00b7 juicebox.js imports none of the others",
